This directory is a modified copy of the gpui_apple crate from Zed v1.28.1
(https://github.com/zed-industries/zed, crates/gpui_apple, commit e8bc16ace).
zyuapp changed it in 2026: the manifest stands alone; the Metal renderer
draws backdrop filters, edge fades, radial gradients and layered shadows,
and blends colours in the display's colour space (src/display_color.rs); the
text system adds letter spacing and picks system and installed faces by
weight as Chromium does.
